$ nexoctl ls mem

$ nexoctl mb mem/photos
Bucket created successfully `mem/photos`.

$ nexoctl mb mem/photos
! nexoctl: error: mem/photos: bucket already exists: photos
[exit 1]

$ nexoctl mb --ignore-existing mem/photos
Bucket `mem/photos` already exists.

$ nexoctl mb --with-versioning mem/docs mem/logs
Bucket created successfully `mem/docs`.
Bucket created successfully `mem/logs`.

$ nexoctl mb mem/x
! nexoctl: error: mem/x: invalid bucket name: x
[exit 1]

$ nexoctl mb mem/photos/key
! nexoctl: error: mem/photos/key: mb takes ALIAS/BUCKET without an object name
! Run 'nexoctl mb --help' for usage.
[exit 2]

$ nexoctl mb mem
! nexoctl: error: mem: a bucket is required (ALIAS/BUCKET)
! Run 'nexoctl mb --help' for usage.
[exit 2]

$ nexoctl ls mem
[2026-01-02 03:04:05 UTC]      0B docs/
[2026-01-02 03:04:05 UTC]      0B logs/
[2026-01-02 03:04:05 UTC]      0B photos/

$ nexoctl stat mem/docs
Name        : docs
Date        : 2026-01-02 03:04:05 UTC
Type        : bucket
Versioning  : Enabled
Anonymous   : private

$ nexoctl version info mem/photos
Versioning of `mem/photos` is not enabled (unversioned).

$ nexoctl rb mem/logs
! nexoctl: error: mem/logs: bucket not empty: logs (use --force to remove its content)
[exit 1]

$ nexoctl rb --force mem/logs
Removed `mem/logs` successfully.

$ nexoctl rb mem/photos mem/missing
Removed `mem/photos` successfully.
! nexoctl: error: mem/missing: bucket not found: missing
[exit 3]

$ nexoctl ls mem
[2026-01-02 03:04:05 UTC]      0B docs/

